# 1️⃣2️⃣ Topological Sort using DFS

## Idea

Visit node completely.

After processing all neighbors:

```text
Push node into stack
```

Finally:

```text
Reverse Stack Order
```

---

## C++ Code

```cpp
void topoDFS(
    int node,
    vector<int> adj[],
    vector<int>& vis,
    stack<int>& st)
{
    vis[node] = 1;

    for(int neighbor : adj[node])
    {
        if(!vis[neighbor])
        {
            topoDFS(
                neighbor,
                adj,
                vis,
                st
            );
        }
    }

    st.push(node);
}
```

---

### Driver

```cpp
vector<int> topoSort(
    int V,
    vector<int> adj[])
{
    vector<int> vis(V,0);

    stack<int> st;

    for(int i=0;i<V;i++)
    {
        if(!vis[i])
        {
            topoDFS(
                i,
                adj,
                vis,
                st
            );
        }
    }

    vector<int> answer;

    while(!st.empty())
    {
        answer.push_back(
            st.top()
        );

        st.pop();
    }

    return answer;
}
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(V + E)

Space: O(V)
```

