# 1️⃣5️⃣ BFS vs DFS Topological Sort

| DFS Topo | Kahn's Algorithm |
|-----------|------------------|
| Stack Based | Queue Based |
| DFS | BFS |
| Easy to implement | Useful for cycle detection |
| O(V+E) | O(V+E) |

