# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Bipartite Graph = 2 Coloring Problem.

✅ Topological Sort works only for DAG.

✅ Kahn's Algorithm uses Indegree.

✅ Cycle Detection is one of the most asked graph topics.

✅ Learn both BFS and DFS approaches.

