# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Forgetting Parent Node in cycle detection.

❌ Applying Topological Sort on cyclic graphs.

❌ Not initializing color array with -1.

❌ Incorrect indegree calculation.

❌ Revisiting nodes repeatedly.

